# Regenerable pipeline outputs only -- data/reference holds real, externally-sourced
# input data (geomagnetic observatory traces) the generator depends on, so it is
# tracked, not ignored. (A bare `data/` entry can't be re-included per-subdirectory:
# git won't descend into an excluded parent to check negation patterns.)
